{
  "_id": "tg-tabernacle",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "let them make me a sanctuary, Ex. 25:8 (26:30). after the pattern of the tabernacle … shall ye make it, Ex. 25:9. tabernacle of the congregation without the veil, Ex. 27:21. tabernacle shall be sanctified by my glory, Ex. 29:43. thou shalt anoint the tabernacle of the congregation, Ex. 30:26 (40:9). Lord … spake unto him out of the tabernacle, Lev. 1:1. when they defile my tabernacle, Lev. 15:31. feast of tabernacles for seven days, Lev. 23:34 (Deut. 16:13). appoint the Levites over the tabernacle of testimony, Num. 1:50. cloud covered the tabernacle, namely, the tent of the testimony, Num. 9:15. Get you up from about the tabernacle of Korah, Num. 16:24. appeared in the tabernacle in a pillar of a cloud, Deut. 31:15. Israel assembled together at Shiloh, and set up the tabernacle, Josh. 18:1 (Judg. 18:31). she went up to the house of the Lord, 1 Sam. 1:7. Zadok … took an horn of oil out of the tabernacle, 1 Kgs. 1:39. the tabernacle of the congregation of God, 2 Chr. 1:3. he set a tabernacle for the sun, Ps. 19:4. holy place of the tabernacles of the most High, Ps. 46:4. tabernacle of the upright shall flourish, Prov. 14:11. shall be a tabernacle for a shadow in the daytime, Isa. 4:6 (2 Ne. 14:6). he shall sit upon it in truth in the tabernacle of David, Isa. 16:5. My tabernacle is spoiled, Jer. 10:20. ye have borne the tabernacle of your Moloch, Amos 5:26 (Acts 7:43). will I raise up the tabernacle of David, Amos 9:11 (Acts 15:16). to keep the feast of tabernacles, Zech. 14:16.",
