      "text": "let us make here three tabernacles, Matt. 17:4 (Mark 9:5; Luke 9:33). Jews’ feast of tabernacles was at hand, John 7:2. desired to find a tabernacle for the God of Jacob, Acts 7:46. earthly house of this tabernacle were dissolved, 2 Cor. 5:1. minister … of the true tabernacle, Heb. 8:2. tabernacle which is called the Holiest of all, Heb. 9:3. by a greater and more perfect tabernacle, not made with hands, Heb. 9:11. he sprinkled with blood both the tabernacle, Heb. 9:21. dwelling in tabernacles with Isaac and Jacob, Heb. 11:9. I must put off this my tabernacle, 2 Pet. 1:14. temple of the tabernacle of the testimony, Rev. 15:5. tabernacle of God is with men, Rev. 21:3.",
